  "_doc": "Redevelopment Agency (RDA) board members, same schema as councilmembers.json. The RDA board IS the City Council: under the agency's 2008 bylaws — recited into the record at the January 6, 2026 organizing meeting — the Mayor serves as Chairperson and the councilmembers serve as Board Members, with a Vice Chairperson elected from the board for a one-year term. So every person here is the same person as in councilmembers.json, with the council role mapped to its agency role (Mayor -> Chairperson, Councilmember -> Board Member) and the same term dates. Keep this file in step with councilmembers.json: when a council term changes there, change it here. Vice Chairperson is an annual office rather than a term and is not modeled. Extend `aliases` whenever the minutes' OCR introduces a new spelling.",
